        "original_id": "020f69e7-349a-5686-85e2-110b0c6ebf6b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Stockdale, Sybil Stockdale, James Woods, Jane Alexander, Steven Vincent Leigh, Ted Kotcheff, Michael O'Keefe, Karen Allen, Peter Fonda, Elizabeth Ashley, Brian Dennehy, Ronnie Scribner\n- Roles: United States Navy vice admiral, aviator, prisoner of war, director, actor\n- Products: In Love and War (1987 film), Split Image (film)\n- Events: Vietnam War\n- Topics: television films, true stories\n\nFacts:\n- James Bond Stockdale was born on December 23, 1923, and he later became a United States Navy vice admiral and aviator.\n- During the Vietnam War, James Stockdale was an American prisoner of war for more than seven years and received the Medal of Honor.\n- In Love and War is a 1987 Vietnam War-based thriller-drama television film.\n- In Love and War stars James Woods and Jane Alexander.\n- In Love and War is based on the true story of James Stockdale and Sybil Stockdale.\n- In 1987, Steven Vincent Leigh appeared in In Love and War.\n- Split Image is a film directed by Ted Kotcheff.\n- Split Image stars Michael O'Keefe, Karen Allen, Peter Fonda, James Woods, Elizabeth Ashley, Brian Dennehy, and Ronnie Scribner.\n- James Stockdale died on July 5, 2005.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
